<title>SWEDEN: TENNIS-FRANCE WIN DOUBLES FOR 2-1 DAVIS CUP LEAD.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-FRANCE WIN DOUBLES FOR 2-1 DAVIS CUP LEAD.</headline>
<dateline>MALMO, Sweden 1996-11-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>France took a 2-1 lead over Sweden in the Davis Cup final when Guy Forget and Guillaume Raoux beat Jonas Bjorkman and Nicklas Kulti 6-3 1-6 6-3 6-3 in the doubles on Saturday.</p>
</text>
